      "writtenOn": "2023-11-17T10:55:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`-fdata-section` creates a section for the variable, but seems not guarantee the section be placed under `.data`.\n\nThe compiler\u0027s behavior on Roach is like this:\n - const -\u003e `.srodata`\n - non-const zero -\u003e `.sbss`\n - non-const non-zero -\u003e `.sdata`\n \nI\u0027m not sure how portable is this, so I think the safest way is to explicit specify a section name.\n\n(rollback_initial_data has a non-zero cookie and large enough (?) so no need to worry about this)",
      "parentUuid": "3bbdf9c4_290c64ab",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 20,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 20,
